WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.494
The standard encounter screens are the tabs an encounter shows when you have no

1.2
00:00:05.494 --> 00:00:08.945
workspace chosen. Step 1. Open the workspace picker.

1.3
00:00:08.945 --> 00:00:11.835
It shows the name of your workspace.

2.1
00:00:11.835 --> 00:00:14.957
Step 2. Reset to the standard workspace.

2.2
00:00:14.957 --> 00:00:20.199
At the bottom of the Workspace panel, select Reset to standard workspace.

2.3
00:00:20.199 --> 00:00:26.013
The picker then shows Standard encounter, and Care opens the Overview tab.
